Where'd you meet him?!
You go to a girls' school.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.150
He's my follower.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:44.520
And the first time we met...

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.940
...he told me.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:46.900
Told you what?

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.900
H-He asked me out.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:53.230
Lucky.

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:56.150
But it's over! There won't be a next time.

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:57.600
What?!

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:58.850
Why?

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:00.980
Was he different on the date?

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:03.020
No.

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:07.100
It was the first time a guy ever asked me out,

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:12.980
so I dressed as girly as I could.
Bare legs and stuff.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:18.810
And when I got to the meeting
place, he looked horrified.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:22.100
Horrified? What for?

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:25.810
He thought I was a boy.

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:31.310
So, that's the funny thing that happened to me.

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.600
We can't laugh at that.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:37.810
Laugh. I'll feel worse otherwise.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:41.850
Oh, here's lunch. I made
my specialty, so eat up.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.940
Excuse me.

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:58.560
What's wrong, Ohto?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:02.900
Is it true you're quitting your job here?

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:07.810
Yes. I think I've figured out a way
to make a living as an artist.

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:10.350
You're not running away?

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:12.060
Running?

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.770
Nothing.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:27.690
Ohto, I'm going to hold a small solo exhibition.

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:29.980
Come see it if you like.

