Tall, cool beauties like you
are totally my type.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:17.230
Oh, okay, I get it.
You don't care if I'm a girl.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:19.270
Just like Haruka.

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:20.600
Haruka?

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:23.850
She's a girl, but she said she loves me.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:26.100
So, a lesbian?

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.230
I'm not like that.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:30.310
You're not?

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:33.600
Inside...

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.520
...I'm a boy.

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:38.440
Huh?

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:45.310
That's crocodile's something else.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.480
Thank you, Panic.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.310
Come here.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:50.650
So, his name's Panic.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:52.350
Are you full?

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:58.350
The hell is this?!

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:06.150
Are you okay, Kaoru?

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.730
I wanted to see you,

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:17.520
Kaoru!

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.020
No!

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:22.850
Let go!

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.730
You're so cute and fair.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:29.230
Almost too fragile to hug.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:33.900
What idiot could believe that
you're a boy "on the inside"?!

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.770
Kaoru!

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.150
Momoe!

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:44.520
Are you after Kaoru, too?!

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:46.600
Who is this guy?

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:51.310
My kendo club advisor. I went to him for advice.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:54.600
I <i>thought</i> he was a good teacher,

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:58.020
but he pushed me down
in the boardinghouse and...

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:05.980
...I... got pregnant.

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:08.940
I felt bad for the baby,

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:11.440
but I... I...

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:16.060
You don't have to say anymore!

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:17.980
I'm strong!

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:23.520
So am I!

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:28.230
You won his trust, then exploited him.

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:30.850
I hate cowards like you more than anyone.

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:34.520
You're after Kaoru, too, aren't you?!

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.020
I'll stab you and your disgusting jealousy!

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:45.690
I'll get you out.

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:50.060
Who said you could get on top of me?!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:00.020
I'll kill any man who makes passes at my Kaoru.

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:03.810
I'll cut off the legs they walk up on
and the mouths they talk with!

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:09.150
How's Momo? Is she all right?

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:12.690
You're always worrying about other people,

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:16.480
but if you don't focus on your
own fight, you'll get tripped up.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:18.190
I know that!

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.440
I know that, but...

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:25.440
Or do you do it to avoid thinking
about your own problems?

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.470
Shuichiro Sawaki
solo exhibition

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.470
Latent Heat

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:30.940
It's all because a painting
I did here won a prize.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.810
The one of Koito?

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:43.190
It's all the way in the back.

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:46.730
I really want you to see it.

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:01.310
Have some confidence, Kaoru!

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:05.150
You're the cutest girl I've ever seen.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:06.560
I'm...

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.900
I'm a boy.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:13.850
I'm a boy!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.770
And...

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.190
...I'm...

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:25.270
...a girl!

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.190
This is it.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:42.150
What?

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:58.100
Get lost!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.480
Jump!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.940
Magnificent!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:08.190
I want to teach you all over again!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.990
Out of service

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.990
Now departing

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:17.440
Next time I'm reborn,
I'll be the one to protect you.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:19.600
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:24.560
Not all girls want to be protected.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:27.060
Yeah? Sorry.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:31.900
What about you?

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:34.900
I don't get a choice about it.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.730
Of course you do.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:43.060
You're a lovely girl.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:47.690
And you're a brave boy.

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.850
Thanks.

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:51.730
You mind younger guys?

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.480
It depends how much younger.

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:58.770
Let me make a reservation.
Don't get a boyfriend until I see you again.

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:00.480
A what?

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:02.980
Kaoru--

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:17.400
Shh!

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:28.900
What's going on?

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:29.900
Five!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:31.100
Four!

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:32.020
Three!

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:33.100
Two!

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:34.190
One!

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:35.310
Zero!

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:43.810
Haruka?

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.560
Momoe.

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:59.440
Huh?

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:05.650
But her statue's gone.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:06.810
It's over.

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:09.060
It's really over!

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.980
Momoe won't be coming anymore.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:22.810
Huh?

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:24.770
She cleared the game?

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:26.230
Exactly.

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:30.400
Work hard so that you can
follow in her footsteps.

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:33.020
Meaning Momoe got out first?

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.850
She could have told us.

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:36.020
I agree.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:44.190
Sorry! I remembered something
I have to do after all!

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.520
I've got to go!

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:47.850
What do you mean, "after all"?

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:49.350
See you, then.

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:54.150
Wanna go for ramen?

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.230
Sure.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:57.940
I'm home!

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:09.020
What is it, Ai?

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:10.310
It's getting late.

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:12.770
Just... stuff with everyone.

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:14.060
Everyone?

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:16.850
Everyone.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.560
Okay.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:25.060
Make sure you message me every 30 minutes.

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.060
Yup. I'm off.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:52.310
Me?

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:55.400
No, it's different?

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:56.730
It's you.

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:59.480
But you grown up.

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:05.900
It's... me grown up?

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:09.150
Don't you think it looks like someone?

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.940
My mom.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.350
Yes.

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:21.850
Someday, you'll be a wonderful,
adult woman like your mother.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:27.400
Kind, strong, and beautiful.

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:31.060
You love my mom, don't you?

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:33.900
Yes. With all my heart.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:38.230
You're her daughter...

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:43.020
...so you should have faith in yourself.

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:46.270
Mr. Sawaki...

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.310
Yes?

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:51.730
There's something I want to ask you.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:58.190
Why did Koito die?

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:05.730
Our plans may end up going off-course.

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:07.770
Looks like it.

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:12.730
To confront Thanatos, we need
warriors of Eros, his polar opposite.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:17.520
Will Momoe go back there for us?

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.730
No clue.

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:21.940
She knows it now.

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:24.770
The overwhelming fear of death.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:39.900
That's not good. Go see a doctor.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:43.230
Congratulations. You completed your mission.

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:45.270
That girl came back to life.

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:46.230
<i>Veni</i> !

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:48.060
I'd like to let you go.

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:52.400
Out of respect for the way you've
risked your life for friendship.

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:57.350
But you see, Frill will get
mad at me if she finds out.

00:19:57.350 --> 00:19:59.060
Frill?

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:02.850
This is a pain, so I'll cut to the chase.

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:04.980
Do you want to die here?

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.190
Well, I figured.

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:25.480
Panic...

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:30.560
In that case, I guess
I'll settle for this thing.

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:39.650
They say crocodile tastes like chicken.

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:48.940
Have some, too.

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:01.600
Are you all right, Momo?

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:17.520
I can't sleep. I can't sleep.
I can't sleep. I can't sleep. I can't sleep.

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:22.690
I can't sleep.

00:22:56.980 --> 00:23:01.980
Next time

00:22:58.350 --> 00:22:59.560
To be continued.
